### bare
args:
exit: 0
stdout: 1624 bytes, cksum 3916089446
| bnrmr \342\200\224 figlet-equivalent ASCII-art banner generator$
| $
| Usage:$
|   bnrmr [FLAGS] TEXT...$
| $
| Flags:$
|   -f, --font NAME       NAME.cyml from $BNRMR_FONTS, ./fonts or the$
|                         install's share/bannermanor/fonts (block is$
|                         built in), or a path ending in .flf for a$
|                         legacy figlet font (default: block)$
|       --align V         left | center | right (default: left)$
|   -w, --width N         truncate at glyph boundary at N columns$
|                         (default: 0 = unlimited; if N is smaller$
|                         than one glyph, no glyphs render \342\200\224 the$
|                         banner comes out as blank rows)$
|       --pad N           N blank lines above and below banner (default: 0)$
|       --color NAME      colorize: black, red, green, yellow, blue,$
|                         magenta, cyan, white (or bright_<name> /$
|                         bright-<name>), or 'rainbow'$
|                         for per-row cycling. Suppressed on non-TTY stdout.$
|       --list-fonts      list the fonts --font can find, and where it$
|                         looked, and exit$
|       --version         print version and exit$
|   -h, --help            print this help and exit$
|       --                end of flags: everything after it is TEXT,$
|                         even a word starting with '-' (bnrmr -- -HI)$
| $
| Coverage: A-Z, 0-9, space, printable punctuation. Lowercase folds$
| to uppercase when the font has no lowercase glyphs. Unsupported$
| characters render as blank.$
| $
| Errors go to stderr with exit status 1, as does a failed write.$
| See bnrmr(1) for the font search path and environment.$
stderr: 0 bytes, cksum 4294967295

